#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Depth"
msgstr "Gate Cutting para Reducir la Profundidad del Circuit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, we will reduce a circuit's depth by cutting distant gates, avoiding the swap gates that would otherwise be introduced by routing.\n"
msgstr "En este tutorial, reduciremos la profundidad de un circuito cortando Gates distantes, evitando los swap gates que de otro modo serían introducidos por el enrutamiento.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take in this [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns):\n"
msgstr "Estos son los pasos que seguiremos en este [patrón de Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Paso 1: Mapear el problema a circuits cuánticos y operadores**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Mapear el hamiltoniano a un circuito cuántico.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Paso 2: Optimizar para el hardware objetivo** [_Usa el cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cortar el circuito y el observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpilar los subexperimentos para el hardware.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Paso 3: Ejecutar en el hardware objetivo**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Ejecutar los subexperimentos obtenidos en el Paso 2 usando una primitiva `Sampler`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Paso 4: Post-procesar los resultados** [_Usa el cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combinar los resultados del Paso 3 para reconstruir el valor esperado del observable en cuestión.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Paso 1: Mapear {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to run on the backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Crear un circuito para ejecutar en el Backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama del circuito cuántico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Especificar un observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Paso 2: Optimizar {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a backend {#specify-a-backend}"
msgstr "Especificar un Backend {#specify-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can provide either a fake backend or a hardware backend from Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Puedes proporcionar un Backend falso o un Backend de hardware de Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuit, visualize the swaps, and note the depth {#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"
msgstr "Transpilar el circuito, visualizar los swaps y observar la profundidad {#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We choose a layout that requires two swaps to execute the gates between qubits 3 and 0 and another two swaps to return the qubits to their initial positions.\n"
msgstr "Elegimos un layout que requiere dos swaps para ejecutar las puertas entre los qubits 3 y 0, y otros dos swaps para devolver los qubits a sus posiciones iniciales.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama del circuito cuántico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace distant gates with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s by specifying their indices {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"
msgstr "Reemplazar Gates distantes con `TwoQubitQPDGate`s especificando sus índices {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`cut_gates` will replace the gates in the specified indices with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s and also return a list of `QPDBasis` instances -- one for each gate decomposition.\n"
msgstr "`cut_gates` reemplazará las puertas en los índices especificados por instancias de `TwoQubitQPDGate` y también devolverá una lista de instancias de `QPDBasis`, una por cada descomposición de puerta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama del circuito cuántico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Generar los subexperimentos para ejecutar en el Backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts a circuit containing `TwoQubitQPDGate` instances and observables as a `PauliList`.\n"
msgstr "`generate_cutting_experiments` acepta un circuito que contiene instancias de `TwoQubitQPDGate` y observables como una `PauliList`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Para simular el valor esperado del circuito de tamaño completo, se generan muchos subexperimentos a partir de la distribución de cuasiprobabilidad conjunta de las puertas descompuestas y luego se ejecutan en uno o más Backends. El número de muestras tomadas de la distribución se controla con `num_samples`, y se da un coeficiente combinado para cada muestra única. Para más información sobre cómo se calculan los coeficientes, consulta el [material explicativo](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `generate_cutting_experiments` is of type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "**Nota:** El argumento ``observables`` de `generate_cutting_experiments` es de tipo `PauliList`. Los coeficientes y las fases de los términos del observable se ignoran durante la descomposición del problema y la ejecución de los subexperimentos. Pueden volver a aplicarse durante la reconstrucción del valor esperado.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Calcular la sobrecarga de muestreo para los cortes elegidos {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut three CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^3$.\n"
msgstr "Aquí cortamos tres Gates CNOT, lo que resulta en una sobrecarga de muestreo de $9^3$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Para más información sobre la sobrecarga de muestreo que conlleva el circuit cutting, consulta el [material explicativo](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Demonstrate that the QPD subexperiments will be shallower after cutting distant gates {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"
msgstr "Demostrar que los subexperimentos QPD serán menos profundos después de cortar las puertas distantes {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here is an example of an arbitrarily chosen subexperiment generated from the QPD circuit. Its depth has been reduced by more than half. Many of these probabilistic subexperiments must be generated and evaluated in order to reconstruct an expectation value of the deeper circuit.\n"
msgstr "Aquí hay un ejemplo de un subexperimento elegido arbitrariamente generado a partir del circuito QPD. Su profundidad se ha reducido en más de la mitad. Muchos de estos subexperimentos probabilísticos deben generarse y evaluarse para reconstruir un valor esperado del circuito más profundo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama del circuito cuántico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Preparar los subexperimentos para el Backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Paso 3: Ejecutar {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Ejecutar los subexperimentos usando la primitiva Sampler de Qiskit Runtime {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Paso 4: Post-procesar {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "Reconstruir el valor esperado {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "Reconstruye los valores esperados para cada término del observable y combínalos para reconstruir el valor esperado del observable original.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Comparar el valor esperado reconstruido con el valor esperado exacto del circuito y observable originales {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

